---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+18435550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(843) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="HVAC Maintenance Support | Charleston SC" description="Air duct cleaning as part of HVAC care in Charleston, SC.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>HVAC Maintenance Support</h1>
      <p>Cleaner ducts help your system work more efficiently.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>Restricted or dirty ducts force your HVAC system to work harder. Professional cleaning complements regular filter changes, coil cleaning, and tune-ups by restoring proper airflow paths.</p>
      <h2>Benefits</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Improved airflow to rooms</li>
        <li>Reduced strain on blower and compressor</li>
        <li>Support for consistent temperatures</li>
        <li>Cleaner air delivered through the system</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
